<title>JAPAN: Sunstar - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sunstar - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.79		vs	   31.86</p>
<p> Operating	    1.24		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Current	    714    million    vs	  629    million</p>
